# sixfiveohtwo stage 7 expectations.
# Decimal mode (NMOS/Bruce Clark): SED/CLD, ADC/SBC with D=1.
#
# All checks apply at the single final marker (M line below): the last
# data write is lda #$A7 / sta $F000, preceded by cld (D=0). Before
# that, the last decimal ADC (99+01 in the SED block) left N=1, Z=1,
# C=1, V=0, none of which cld or lda #$A7 except N/Z (N=1, Z=0 after
# lda #$A7). I is the untouched reset value 1 (SEI/CLI never used).
# X=$00 (X is never used; also proves decimal ops leave it alone),
# Y=$02 (ldy #$02 for the SBC (zp),Y block, never changed after),
# SP=$FD (seven PHP/PLA pairs, all balanced, no JSR). PC is the
# address after the final 3-byte sta $F000 at $03CC.
#
# Decimal model recap for the checkpoints: ADC (D=1) sets N/V from the
# pre-correction high-nibble sum (e.g. 58+46 -> N=1 V=1 although the
# result $04 is positive) and Z from the decimal result; SBC (D=1)
# sets N/V/Z strictly from the binary difference while result/C come
# from the decimal correction -- the PHP/PLA bytes below pin those
# (P is pushed as N V 1 B D I Z C; D=1 I=1 gives base $3C, D=0 gives
# base $34 in the CLD block).

M F000 A7

F N 1
F Z 0
F C 1
F V 0
F D 0
F I 1
R A A7
R X 00
R Y 02
R S FD
R P 03CF

# --- decimal ADC immediate ---
C F100 04
C F101 00
C F102 01
C F103 10
C F104 05
C F105 00
C F106 01

# --- decimal ADC zp/abs/(zp),Y ---
C F107 05
C F108 99
C F109 81

# --- decimal SBC immediate ---
C F10A 25
C F10B 00
C F10C 99
C F10D 60
C F10E 50
C F10F 49
C F110 99
C F111 80

# --- decimal SBC zp/abs/(zp),Y ---
C F112 34
C F113 37
C F114 30

# --- SBC N/V/Z binary proofs: results + PHP/PLA P bytes ---
C F115 25
C F116 3D
C F117 99
C F118 BC
C F119 00
C F11A 3F
C F11B 60
C F11C FC
C F11D 80
C F11E BD
C F11F 79
C F120 7D
C F121 B0
C F122 3C

# --- ORA/shifts unaffected by D=1 ---
C F123 8F
C F124 80
C F125 01
C F126 80
C F127 40
C F128 00

# --- CLD/SED toggling: binary $9A vs decimal $00, D bit in P ---
C F129 9A
C F12A B4
C F12B 00
C F12C BF

# --- fail-guard markers must NOT have been stored ---
C F1E0 00
C F1E1 00
C F1E2 00
C F1E3 00
C F1E4 00
C F1E5 00
C F1E6 00
C F1E7 00
C F1E8 00
C F1E9 00
C F1EA 00
C F1EB 00
C F1EC 00

# --- setup scratch, zero page (operands, pointers) ---
C 20 46
C 21 18
C 40 10
C 41 F2
C 42 20
C 43 F2

# --- setup scratch, absolute (operands) ---
C F200 32
C F201 13
C F211 45
C F222 19
